   "finding": "Solving for fuel instead of traveltime returns a byte-identical path at every ice limit tested.",
   "why": "zero_currents is True and PolarRoute's wave-added-resistance function is dead code in 1.1.11, so fuel is a monotone function of time and there is no trade-off surface.",
