   "id": "reachability-cliff",
   "finding": "Bharati is reachable at assumed limits of 50% and above, and unreachable at 45% and below.",
   "why": "Dijkstra cannot connect the waypoints once too many cells close.",
   "consequence": "Reachability of the destination rests on an assumed threshold with a cliff edge, not on a certificated limit."
  }
